Source of a running build
-------------------------
The game's menu links "Source code" to the commit of this repository it was built from. Each release also publishes
BUILD.json beside the page, naming every source it was built from:

- this repository (the page and the browser runtime)  frontendSourceCommit, runtimeSource.webgame
- the OpenRA engine (fork github.com/alibad/OpenRA)   runtimeSource.engine
- the RTS AI mod (github.com/alibad/RTSAI-Mod)         runtimeSource.mod, inputs
- the RTS AI website (RTSAI-Web), whose unit cards,   release.site
  Earth compiler and UI kit (web/src/components/ui)
  are compiled into the page


Built on
--------
OpenRA            GPL-3.0-or-later  https://github.com/OpenRA/OpenRA (contributors: its AUTHORS file)
RTS AI mod        GPL-3.0           https://github.com/alibad/RTSAI-Mod

