DiscordRichPresence, Pfim, Linguini, Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyModel) are listed with their licences in OpenRA's
AUTHORS file. All are GPL-3.0 compatible (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, LGPL, GPL).


