Original Command & Conquer content is not in this repository and must never be committed (.gitignore blocks its
archives). The live game's isometric mode loads original Red Alert 2 art, unit voices and sounds from a separate
package, under EA's free, non-commercial Command & Conquer modding guidelines; no C&C music is used. Two things here
refer to that content and remain EA's property: tools/data/ra2-retail.json (unit values and names read from Red
Alert 2's rules.ini and art.ini) and the gameplay screenshots in evals/.
